IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROXY-TEST-PROG.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT CONFIG-FILE ASSIGN TO 'proxy_config.txt'
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  FS-CONFIG-FILE.
    05 FS-LINE           PIC X(80).
01  WS-STATUS           PIC X(20) VALUE 'INITIALIZING'.
01  WS-PORT-FOUND       PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY '--- STARTING PROXY CONFIGURATION CHECK ---'.
    OPEN INPUT CONFIG-FILE.
    
    * Simulation de lecture d'une ligne de configuration
    * Dans un vrai cas, on chercherait le port Xray
    MOVE 'PORT:10809' TO FS-LINE.
    
    IF FS-LINE(1:4) = 'PORT'
        MOVE FS-LINE(6:4) TO WS-PORT-FOUND
        MOVE 'SUCCESS' TO WS-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE 'FAILURE' TO WS-STATUS
    END-IF.

    DISPLAY 'STATUS: ' WS-STATUS.
    DISPLAY 'DETECTED PORT: ' WS-PORT-FOUND.
    
    CLOSE CONFIG-FILE.
    DISPLAY '--- END OF CHECK ---'.
    STOP RUN.